ADDITIONAL NOTICE — INTENDED USE

This software is intended for monitoring devices that you own, with the informed
consent of the person who carries them — most commonly a parent monitoring their
own minor child. It is built so that the person carrying the device can always
see that monitoring is active and can stop it.

Using this software to monitor another adult without their knowledge or consent
is unlawful in many jurisdictions (including under India's IT Act 2000, the EU
GDPR, and the US Electronic Communications Privacy Act) and is contrary to the
intent of this project. The authors accept no liability for such use; see
docs/LEGAL.md for the full position.

This project deliberately does not implement hidden operation, message-app
interception, keylogging, remote camera or microphone access, or call
interception. Forks that add those capabilities do so in violation of this
licence's intent, and the authors disclaim all responsibility for them.
